  "Question": "Five points \\(O,\\) \\(A,\\) \\(B,\\) \\(C,\\) \\(D\\) are taken in order on a straight line with distances \\(OA=a,\\) \\(OB=b,\\) \\(OC=c,\\) and \\(OD=d.\\) \\(P\\) is a point on the line between \\(B\\) and \\(C\\) and such that \\(AP:PD=BP:PC.\\) Then \\(OP\\) equals:",
